    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the house and discover what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dense atmosphere, supported by a short and profound story, underscores the fact that you are not alone in this house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to escape this nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mindbound is a psychological horror game based on a walking-simulator.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the house and discover what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dense atmosphere, supported by a short and profound story, underscores the fact that you are not alone in this house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to escape this nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mindbound is a psychological horror game based on a walking-simulator.</p>",
